{"title": "Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)", "pageid": 47143, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hoots'_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You're pretty sure you could speak to animals if you tried. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WYR_POTENTDRINK_PETPAL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_POTENTDRINK_PETPAL+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WYR_POTENTDRINK_PETPAL+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">PETPAL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPETPAL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPETPAL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Grants the ability to talk to animals like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Condition)\">Speak with Animals</a>, but grants <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a> checks against <a href=\"/wiki/Beast\" title=\"Beast\">Beasts</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Hoots.27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Hoots'_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue\">Sources of Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch\">Hoots' Hooch</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>PETPAL</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hoots'_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You're pretty sure you could speak to animals if you tried.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Speak_with_Animals\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals_(Condition)\" title=\"Speak with Animals (Condition)\">Speak with Animals</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Can comprehend and communicate with <a href=\"/wiki/Beasts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Beasts\">beasts</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203038\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2081/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29182/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7704/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/